- I need to track time since the beacon started
- On each update, I get `deltaMs`
- I accumulate time
- Compute phase = (accumulatedTime % periodSeconds)
- If phase < 0.1: intensity = (phase / 0.1) * strength
- If phase < 0.2: intensity = (1 - (phase - 0.1) / 0.1) * strength
- Else: intensity = 0

